[
    {
        "title": "Overview",
        "slug": "index",
        "body": "<p>Hi! Here you can browse and download all sheet music I've created. You can also visit my <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@EliasKSheetMusic\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube channel</a> to discover more.</p><p>Sometimes, when I can't find sheet music for a song, I decide to make it myself (if I can bring myself to work with MuseScore ಠ_ಠ) You can find piano and choir arrangements here.</p><p>I've made sheet music for the following video games, animes &amp; artists:</p>{{overviewNavigation}}",
        "background": "<video playsinline autoplay loop muted poster=\"img/index-bg.jpg\"><source src=\"img/index-bg.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>"
    },
    {
        "title": "Imagine Dragons",
        "slug": "imagine-dragons",
        "summary": "Enemy",
        "body": "<p>This is a song from the Netflix series <em>Arcane</em>, created by <em>Imagine Dragons</em>. The arrangement was inspired by the a capella group <em><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ojlEskF5HX0\" target=\"_blank\">MayTree</a></em>.</p><p>You can listen to the song or download it for free. Have fun!</p>{{songs}}",
        "songs": [
            {
                "title": "Enemy",
                "subtitle": "Short Ver. (SATBB choir)",
                "video": "https://youtu.be/NPQ4gwm2O6I",
                "pdf": "docs/assets/imagine-dragons/Enemy (Short).pdf",
                "mid": "docs/assets/imagine-dragons/Enemy (Short).mid",
                "mp3": "docs/assets/imagine-dragons/Enemy (Short).mp3",
                "mscz": "docs/assets/imagine-dragons/Enemy (Short).mscz"
            }
        ]
    },
