    {
        "title": "Foxes",
        "slug": "foxes",
        "summary": "Glorious",
        "body": "<p>This is a song from the album <em>Glorious</em> by <em><a href=\"https://twitter.com/iamfoxes/\" target=\"_blank\">Foxes</a></em>.</p><p>Two versions are available: A short and an extended one (which has another chorus at the end and is more difficult). The <a href=\"http://youtu.be/Odu3fWtTx3s\" target=\"_blank\">background instrumental</a> was made by <em><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC__viPsXI_bHE6M_r_7fR-w\" target=\"_blank\">_SLP</a></em>.</p><p>You can listen to the song or download it for free. Have fun!</p>{{songs}}",
