    {
        "title": "Florence + The Machine",
        "slug": "florence",
        "summary": "Which Witch, Moderation",
        "body": "<p>These are some songs from <em><a href=\"http://florenceandthemachine.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Florence + The Machine</a></em>. <em>Which Witch</em> is from her third album, <em>How Big, How Blue, How Beautiful</em>. <em>Moderation</em> has been released as a single in January 2019.</p><p>The <a href=\"http://youtu.be/WB-cvAM28SQ\" target=\"_blank\">arrangement</a> for <em>Which Witch</em> was made by <em><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCl2_EEC-il22FQ2_jU5Lp-Q\" target=\"_blank\">An Almighty Sound</a></em>, I've only created the sheet music for it. In the background you can hear the incredible <a href=\"http://youtu.be/SjRNpmSWl_8\" target=\"_blank\">instrumental remake</a> made by <em><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCLBvnq5KmCfcpwVKMyU3CSw\" target=\"_blank\">Highway Monster</a></em>.</p><p>You can listen to each song or download it for free. Have fun!</p>{{songs}}",
        "songs": [
            {
                "title": "Which Witch",
                "subtitle": "(piano)",
                "video": "https://youtu.be/FFj92WIFJhs",
                "pdf": "docs/assets/florence/Which Witch.pdf",
